  "app_id": 3339810,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Ballest of Them All is a physics ball game that rewards creative routes and clean movement. Beat your personal best with smarter routes, better jumps, and smoother landings—then beat everyone else. COMPETE ON GLOBAL LEADERBOARDS Race your PB to refine your run, or study faster players’ ghosts to learn their routes and beat their times. CLIMB THE TOWER 14 floors of Ballest's toughest tricks and challenges, no checkpoints. RACE THROUGH 150+ WORKSHOP TRACKS OR BUILD YOUR OWN Browse quick sprints, technical challenges, trick courses, and strange experiments in the Hub. Use the built-in Track Editor to create your own and share it in-game or through Steam Workshop. CUSTOMIZE YOUR BALL Show off your style with hats, skins, and goal explosions."
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
